<title>UK: Sheffield United name Spackman manager.</title>
<headline>Sheffield United name Spackman manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>English first division football club Sheffield United Plc said on Friday that Nigel Spackman has been appointed as manager following the departure of Howard Kendall last month.</p>
<p>Spackman had been acting as caretaker manager to the club since Kendall's move to Everton Football Club. He had been assistant manager since July 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
